          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "آلودگی (âludegi) — \"pollution\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "آلودگی هوا در شهرهای بزرگ زیاد است. âludegi-ye havâ dar shahrhâ-ye bozorg ziyâd ast. Air pollution is high in big cities."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From âlude \"dirty, polluted\", the participle of âludan \"to stain\", + -gi."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "آلودگی (âludegi) is native Persian, built on âlude \"stained, polluted\", the participle of âludan \"to stain\", with the noun suffix -gi."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
