          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بازیافت (bâzyâft) — \"recycling\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بازیافت کاغذ درختها را نجات میدهد. bâzyâft-e kâghaz derakhthâ râ nejât midahad. Recycling paper saves trees."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Bâz \"again, back\" + yâft \"found\", from yâftan \"to find\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بازیافت (bâzyâft) is a modern native coinage built from bâz \"back, again\" + yâft, the past stem of yâftan \"to find\". Recycling finds a material again."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
