              "text": "مصرف (masraf) — \"consumption, use\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مصرف برق در تابستان بالا میرود. masraf-e barq dar tâbestân bâlâ miravad. Electricity use goes up in summer."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also the dosage of a medicine: tarz-e masraf."
            }
          ]
        },
